- `docs/cycle27-plan.md:2559` (cycle 64, **2026-09-21**, the same day): *"**53(d⁷)'s save-bypass branch is REJECTED** — it would have bought a `gui_save` GUI exception on every S3b row for ever, and nothing needed bypassing."*
