`archive/peer/2026-09-19-retrospective-cycle42.md:243`: *"**Finding 1 (repeated failure, keystroke save, 3rd occurrence):** accepted. Run 11 removes the save entirely; `docs/cycle27-plan.md` Pre-decided 20 is marked SUPERSEDED so no future session re-cuts a save→restart build on its strength."*

