### A3 — CONTRADICTED (ii): A4 FIX 3 deletes the provenance the two items it cites require it to keep

- **Side 1 — Pre-decided 85**, `docs/cycle27-plan.md:3031-3033`: *"The only thing worth asserting is **the sink receives the value from the intended source terminal**. Everything else has been an instrument pointed at the wrong quantity."*
